"INFO_WIDGETS_1" = "Widgets use your saved places. You choose the place when editing the widget; tapping it opens the place in the app. The system decides when widgets refresh in the background. Pay attention to the data age shown.";
"INFO_WIDGETS_2" = "Your saved places are transferred with name, coordinates and identifier to your paired Apple Watch if Showers is installed there. The transfer may be delayed. A current location that has not been saved is not transferred.";
